# TCP/IP Model

The TCP/IP Model is a networking model used for communication over the Internet.

## 4 Layers

1. Application Layer
2. Transport Layer
3. Internet Layer
4. Network Access Layer

## Examples

| Layer | Examples |
|---|---|
| Application | HTTP, DNS, FTP |
| Transport | TCP, UDP |
| Internet | IP, ICMP |
| Network Access | Ethernet, Wi-Fi |

## Key Point

TCP/IP is the practical networking model used for communication across the Internet.
